  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya By-product Total Mixed Fermentation Feed Project(Seed2/2025-2027/500 million KRW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the livestock crisis in rural areas of Kenya, we will introduce proven fermented feed technology from Korea to produce feed using agricultural by-products, which will be supplied to large-scale farms. This will reduce feed costs and increase milk yield, while cooperation with livestock cooperatives will help increase the income of smallholder farmers and establish a sustainable supply chain.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance farm income and reducing poverty through the supply of high-quality, low-cost fermented feed based on agricultural by-products in KenyaTMF &#xC0AC;&#xB8CC; &#xC2E4;&#xC99D;&#xB370;&#xBAA8; &#xC900;&#xBE44; &#xBC0F; &#xB18D;&#xC5C5;&#xBD80;&#xC0B0;&#xBB3C; &#xBD80;&#xAC00;&#xAC00;&#xCE58; 10% &#xCC3D;&#xCD9C;, TMF &#xC0AC;&#xB8CC; &#xD604;&#xC9C0;&#xC2E4;&#xC99D; &#xBC0F; &#xCD95;&#xC0B0;&#xBB3C; &#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xB7C9; 10% &#xC99D;&#xB300;, 2&#xAC1C; &#xAE30;&#xAD00;/&#xC870;&#xD569; &#xB9E4;&#xCD9C;&#xC7A5;&#xBD80; &#xBC0F; &#xAD50;&#xC721;&#xC0DD; &#xB9AC;&#xC2A4;&#xD2B8;</narrative>
  </description>
